        },
        "parms": "2. The right one, dial 0 1000 3, bends the same range with an exponent of 3: out = minimum + (maximum - minimum) × position³. Click 0.5: both knobs point to the middle, but the left sends 500 and the right 125. Click 0 and 1: at the ends they agree.",
