      },
      "object 15": {
        "ID": 15,
        "gui": {
          "x": "430.0",
          "y": "350.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "3. An exponent above 1 gives finer control at the bottom of the range, which suits a frequency or a gain. Below 1 does the opposite. A number outside 0 to 1 is clamped, and a bang sends the value again.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
      "object 16": {
