          "x": "430.0",
          "y": "460.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "4. The fourth argument, intMode, rounds. Click 0.75: dial 0 10 1 1 sends the int 8 (a half rounds away from 0), while dial 0 10 sends 7.5.",
